{{Nihongo|'''Akihide Tsumura'''|津村明秀}} is an active Japanese [[jockey]] of [[thoroughbred]] [[race horses]].<ref>{{Cite web |last=INC |first=SANKEI DIGITAL |date=2025-07-12 |title=津村明秀騎手がJRA通算700勝「師匠の馬で決めることができて本当にうれしく思います」 |url=https://www.sanspo.com/race/article/general/20250712-W3FXOF7FOZOXFCVTNOHWMHTBL4/ |access-date=2026-01-24 |website=サンスポZBAT! |language=ja}}</ref>

In 2024, he won his first Grade 1 race with [[Ten Happy Rose]] at the [[Victoria Mile]].<ref>{{Cite web |date=2024-05-12 |title=Ten Happy Rose Springs Upset in Victoria, Secures Berth to Breeders' Cup |url=https://www.thoroughbreddailynews.com/ten-happy-rose-springs-upset-in-victoria-secures-berth-to-breeders-cup/ |access-date=2026-01-24 |website=Thoroughbred Daily News |language=en}}</ref>

On October 5, 2025, he won the [[Mainichi Ōkan]] with Lebensstil, marking his first GII victory.<ref>{{Cite web |last=INC |first=SANKEI DIGITAL |date=2025-10-06 |title=【毎日王冠】5番人気レーベンスティール、レースレコードで重賞4勝目 津村明秀騎手「やはり力はありますね」 |url=https://www.sanspo.com/race/article/general/20251006-G63BBTD5ZBMC3GQJXWH2DZR6OA/ |access-date=2026-01-24 |website=サンスポZBAT! |language=ja}}</ref>

