'''Åse Louise Mörk''' ([[née]] '''Fredriksson'''; born 1993) is a Swedish politician from the [[Swedish Social Democratic Party|Social Democrats]] who was a member of the [[Riksdag]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=Louise Mörk (S) |url=https://www.riksdagen.se/sv/ledamoter-och-partier/ledamot/louise-mork_ee0713c7-695e-4368-84e8-ce91d2821fa9/ |access-date=2026-07-18 |website=www.riksdagen.se |language=sv}}</ref>

She and her husband have one child.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Gustafsson |first=Mari |date=2020-05-09 |title=Louise Mörk om sin kamp för att bilda familj |url=https://www.pt.se/nyheter/blasmark/artikel/louise-mork-om-sin-kamp-for-att-bilda-familj/1l7z198j |access-date=2026-07-18 |website=www.pt.se |language=sv}}</ref> She was chairwoman of the children and youth committee in [[Piteå]].<ref>{{Cite web |last=Abrahamsson |first=Olov |date=2022-06-20 |title=Mörk kliver fram när Tapojärvi kliver av |url=https://www.nsd.se/ledare/ledarbloggen/artikel/mork-kliver-fram-nar-tapojarvi-kliver-av/rk1op4mj |access-date=2026-07-18 |website=www.nsd.se |language=sv}}</ref>

